<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Lear's German unit buy of Keiper.</title>
<headline>EU clears Lear's German unit buy of Keiper.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Monday it had cleared the purchase by Germany's Lear Corporation GmbH, offshoot of the U.S. firm of the same name, of Keiper Car Seating GmbH, a producer of complete seat systems.</p>
<p>Lear is a producer of car seats and interior components.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
